OL,3,CComedian Jimmy Cricket dies aged 80
OL,4,Cfollowing short illness
OL,6,FComedian Jimmy Cricket has died aged
OL,7,F80 following a short illness.
OL,9,FThe Northern Irish stand-up comedian
OL,10,Fdied on Monday morning after spending
OL,11,Fthe last few days "surrounded by his
OL,12,Ffamily, love, laughter and songs", a
OL,13,Fstatement from his family said.
OL,15,FPosting on his social media pages, the
OL,16,Fstatement read: "Jimmy brought so much
OL,17,Flaughter and happiness to countless
OL,18,Faudiences in his career over the years.
OL,26,@sD@SOUtD@aO]xD@QOU
