OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1785779368
OL,3,CComedian Jimmy Cricket dies aged 80
OL,4,Cfollowing short illness
OL,6,F"Whether on stage, screen or radio, or
OL,7,Fif you met him in person as well. But
OL,8,Fthat was nothing to the happiness he
OL,9,Fgave to his family.
OL,11,F"A devoted husband to May for fifty
OL,12,Ftwo years. A wonderful dad to his four
OL,13,Fchildren and very silly grandad indeed
OL,14,Fto his four grandchildren."
OL,16,FThe statement praised Cricket for
OL,17,Fbeing the family's "greatest champion"
OL,18,Fadding that he "loved us all loudly".
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUvD@[O]yD@TOUyD@fO]zD@POUzD@
OL,26,AdO]
