OL,3,CComedian Jimmy Cricket dies aged 80
OL,4,Cfollowing short illness
OL,6,FIt continued: "He also just loved
OL,7,Fpeople and he absolutely loved being a
OL,8,Fstand-up comedian. What a life he
OL,9,Flived.
OL,11,F"Forever our clown, he was cracking
OL,12,Fjokes to the wonderful NHS staff and
OL,13,Fto us all, right until the end. His
OL,14,Fcourage, dignity and positivity
OL,15,Fthrough all he endured was
OL,16,Finspirational. A force for joy, we are
OL,17,Fjust all very sad that the world is a
OL,18,Ffar less sillier place today."
OL,26,@nD@OOUsD@AOUzD@^O]
