OL,3,CComedian Jimmy Cricket dies aged 80
OL,4,Cfollowing short illness
OL,6,FThe Cookstown-born comic previously
OL,7,Fposted on his website that he was
OL,8,Ftaking a "little sabbatical for health
OL,9,Freasons" and had started treatment. It
OL,10,Fadded, however, that he would "catch
OL,11,Fup" with fans at string of shows in
OL,12,Fautumn 2026.
